      <Comment source="pmngroup">Comparative metabolite profiling between wild type plants and the HOTHEAD mutants indicated a deficiency in oxidizing long chain &amp;omega;-hydroxyfatty acids to &amp;omega;-oxo fatty acids. The protein sequence of HOTHEAD shares similarity to long-chain fatty acid &amp;omega;-alcohol dehydrogenase from Candida species.</Comment>
